      "edition": "Current .NET test-platform guidance and xUnit v3, MSTest v4, NUnit 4, and TUnit references checked 2026-11-14",
      "items": [
        "The test platform is distinct from the test framework. MSTest, NUnit, and xUnit can use VSTest and Microsoft.Testing.Platform where documented; TUnit is built on Microsoft.Testing.Platform and does not support VSTest.",
        "xUnit.net v3 is a major line with updated package and runner boundaries; follow v3-specific setup rather than assuming v2 instructions still apply.",
        "MSTest v4 removes configurable ClassCleanupLifecycle; EndOfClass is the supported class cleanup behavior."
      ],
